# Electro, Assaulting Battery: "You don't lose unspent red mana as steps and phases end" (CR 500.5). The rulings say that
# red mana can be spent in a later step, phase or turn, and that other mana is still lost. Turn 1: Black Lotus pays
# for Electro, then Mox Ruby and Mox Emerald add {R}{G}; the {G} empties with the step and the {R} stays into Bot2's turn.
# Bot2's own red mana empties as usual. Turn 3: Mox Ruby adds a second {R}. Lightning Bolt spends one, and Electro's
# trigger (an instant was cast) adds {R}. Raging Goblin, a creature spell, spends one more and triggers nothing. Bot1
# ends with the one {R}.

